---
import { version } from '../../data/site';
---

<section class="section install" id="install">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Install</h2>
      <p>macOS 26+ (Tahoe) on Apple Silicon.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="methods">
      <div class="method">
        <h3>Homebrew</h3>
        <pre class="mono" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="Homebrew install command">brew install --cask omniwm</pre>
        <p>Official cask; the project tap is retired. Quit OmniWM, then upgrade with <span class="mono">brew upgrade omniwm</span>.</p>
        <p><a href="/guides/install/#homebrew">Upgrade and tap migration notes →</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="method">
        <h3>Nix</h3>
        <pre class="mono" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="Nix install command">nix profile install nixpkgs#omniwm</pre>
        <p>Packaged in nixpkgs, with an official Home Manager module for launchd and declarative settings.</p>
        <p><a href="/guides/install/#nix">Home Manager setup and channel notes →</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="method">
        <h3>Direct download</h3>
        <p>
          Grab <span class="mono">OmniWM-v{version}.zip</span> from GitHub Releases, unzip, and
          drop <span class="mono">OmniWM.app</span> into <span class="mono">/Applications</span>.
        </p>
        <p><a href="https://github.com/BarutSRB/OmniWM/releases/latest">Download the latest release ↗</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="perms">
      <b>First launch checklist:</b> turn <i>Displays have separate Spaces</i> ON (then log out and back in), and
      grant <i>Accessibility</i> + <i>Input Monitoring</i>. <i>Screen Recording</i> is optional — it powers
      Overview thumbnails. Full steps in the <a href="/guides/install/">installation guide</a>.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .methods {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .method {
    padding: 22px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--page-frame-border);
    background: var(--page-surface);
  }

  .method h3 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .method p {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    color: var(--page-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .method pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--demo-term-bg);
    color: var(--demo-term-fg);
    font-size: 13px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .method a {
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .method a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .perms {
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--page-accent);
    background: var(--page-accent-soft);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
